#: gio/gsettings-tool.c:686
msgid ""
"Usage:\n"
"  gsettings --version\n"
"  gsettings [--schemadir SCHEMADIR] COMMAND [ARGS…]\n"
"\n"
"Commands:\n"
"  help                      Show this information\n"
"  list-schemas              List installed schemas\n"
"  list-relocatable-schemas  List relocatable schemas\n"
"  list-keys                 List keys in a schema\n"
"  list-children             List children of a schema\n"
"  list-recursively          List keys and values, recursively\n"
"  range                     Queries the range of a key\n"
"  describe                  Queries the description of a key\n"
"  get                       Get the value of a key\n"
"  set                       Set the value of a key\n"
"  reset                     Reset the value of a key\n"
"  reset-recursively         Reset all values in a given schema\n"
"  writable                  Check if a key is writable\n"
"  monitor                   Watch for changes\n"
"\n"
"Use “gsettings help COMMAND” to get detailed help.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Gebruikage:\n"
"  gsettings --version\n"
"  gsettings [--schemadir SCHEMADIR] COMMAND [ARGS…]\n"
"\n"
"Bevele:\n"
"  help                      Wys hierdie inligting\n"
"  list-schemas              Lys geïnstalleerde skemas\n"
"  list-relocatable-schemas  Lys hervestigbare skemas\n"
"  list-keys                 Lys sleutels in 'n skema\n"
"  list-children             Lys kinders van 'n skema\n"
"  list-recursively          Lys sleutels en waardes, rekursief\n"
"  range                     Vra die reeks van 'n sleutel\n"
"  describe                  Doen navrae oor die beskrywing van 'n sleutel\n"
"  get                       Kry die waarde van 'n sleutel\n"
"  set                       Stel die waarde van 'n sleutel\n"
"  reset                     Terugstel die waarde van 'n sleutel\n"
"  reset-recursively         Terugstel alle waardes in 'n gegewe skema\n"
"  writable                  Kontroleer of 'n sleutel skryfbaar is\n"
"  monitor                   Watch vir veranderinge\n"
"\n"
"Gebruik “gsettings help COMMAND” om gedetailleerde hulp te kry.\n"
"\n"

